handbook - Voiced by Guy Harris - www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"uploadDate\":\"2014-06-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Another book from the Epic game Minecraft. This time I voice the trailer for the combat handbook. Still not played it yet.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/save-water","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Save Water Explainer","aria-label":"Previous: Save Water Explainer","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/joker-voice","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"The Joker Voice","aria-label":"Next: The Joker Voice","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A Quirky voice</h2>\r\n<p> They wanted this one to have a little quirkiness to the read style. Almost a little bit like Simon from the InBetweeners. So, I sent a few voice samples and this is the one they approved. The script was very witty and well put together so it was a breeze to voice for them. Minecraft is one of the most successful games ever, so they had the budget to put great quality visuals and great music as well. I always like working with big companies because the higher production quality just makes my voiceover look even better. I think it turned out rather well. If you want to see more examples of game trailers and ads voiced by me, check out my <a href=\"/siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Siegecraft Commander\">Siegecraft Commander</a>, <a href=\"/the-escapists-game-trailer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Escapists\">The Escapists</a>, and <a href=\"/penarium-game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Penarium\">Penarium</a> game trailers. </p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TISd_9l7ZvA","title":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/minecraft-combat-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>What is the Minecraft Combat Handbook?</h2>\r\n<p><i>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.minecraft.net/en-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Minecraft\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Minecraft</a> is a multi-platform block-based gaming sensation available on Xbox, PlayStation, PC and mobile devices. Whether you're in Creative, Survival or Hardcore Mode, the Minecraft books contain all the advice you need to survive and thrive! In Minecraft, you’re never alone! There are dangers lurking around each and every corner. The Minecraft Combat Handbook is essential reading for Minecraft warriors.</i> There's something really fun about flicking through a physical gaming guide rather than just searching online and this book is the perfect present for anyone you know who loves Minecraft. It's an incredible game with so much depth to it. It was also great to work with Mojang, the company behind Minecraft.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for this voice style for your next <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailer</a>? Please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a> if you'd like to work with me. I'd be very happy to send a short sample of your script to you before you book me. Please send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Minecraft Combat Voiceover","pageUrl":"minecraft-combat-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","666",{"href":"/walkers-crisps-spell-go","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/walkers-crisps-spell-go.jpg","alt":"Walkers Crisps Spell Go","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Walkers Spell Go - Computer Voice"}]]}],["$","$L3","883",{"href":"/the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/official-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg","alt":"the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Guy Harris is the Official Voice of Santa"}]]}],["$","$L3","512",{"href":"/land-of-eyas-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blo